wmpulsemixer (PulseAudio mixer dockapp for Window Maker)

wmpulsemixer is a volume control dockapp designed for the Window Maker
desktop environment. It uses libpulse and supports PulseAudio and
PipeWire's PulseAudio compatibility layer.

The upstream project is distributed under the GNU General Public
License, version 2.0. See COPYING in the package documentation.
